WEBVTT

00:06:29.780 --> 00:06:31.385
na ukrštanju linija i prevojima

00:06:31.385 --> 00:06:34.559
jer sam morao da nadomestim

00:06:34.559 --> 00:06:37.505
efekat razlivanja mastila

00:06:37.505 --> 00:06:41.242
po jeftinom papiru.

00:06:41.242 --> 00:06:44.492
Te nepravilnosti su tu kako bi ublažile

00:06:44.492 --> 00:06:47.244
nepovoljan uticaj veličine slova

00:06:47.244 --> 00:06:49.530
i procesa proizvodnje.

00:06:49.530 --> 00:06:52.376
U AT&amp;T su na samom početku

00:06:52.376 --> 00:06:55.617
želeli imenike da ispišu Helvetikom,

00:06:55.617 --> 00:06:57.282
ali u filmu o Helvetici, ako ste

00:06:57.282 --> 00:06:59.785
ga gledali, moj prijatelj
Erik Spikerman kaže

00:06:59.785 --> 00:07:01.820
kako su slova tog pisma dizajnirana